    "Cost": 4826967,
    "UIName": "DevastatUrb",
    "Id": "chassisdef_devastaturb_UMD-R1337R",
    "Name": "DevastatUrb",
    "Details": "Love Urbies? Love those shows with combining mechs? So did some pirates, who kidnapped several Clan superheavy-mech researchers and forced them to create this monstrosity. Built from the frames of 5 Urbanmechs, and fielding even more weaponry, the DevastatUrb is the mech of your UrbieDreams. This variant was introduced as a step between the -R1337 and the -R1337X, being mostly similar to the latter. The major difference is the replacing of Ultra AC/10 in the left arm in favor of a Rotary AC/2.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: 360° Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.34</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_devastaturb"
  },
  "VariantName": "UMD-R1337R",
