  "StockRole": "Urbomination",
  "YangsThoughts": "Before you even say it, no, the rocket-assisted combining thing detailed in the cockpit does not work. I have no idea why they though that would, but carrying around so much fuel and transformation mechanisms just makes for a very crappy LAM. Oh crap... NO! We're not going to make one of these from Urbie LAMs, it wouldn't even work like that! Just be happy it's the massive Urbie of your dreams and will freak out most green troops. Heck, it even has some fancy Clan armor and weaponry!",
